{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00254","headline":"唐武氏享先庙乐章 · 则天皇后","name":"唐武氏享先庙乐章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先德谦撝冠昔，严规节素超今。\n奉国忠诚每竭，承家至孝纯深。\n追崇惧乖尊意，显号恐玷徽音。\n既迫王公屡请，方乃俯遂羣心。\n有限无由展敬，奠醑每阙亲斟。\n大礼虔申典册，苹藻敬荐翘襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"则天皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}